Colour data
-----------

The colour names, CMYK recipes, hex values and combination memberships in
data/ (built from data-raw/) derive from
https://github.com/mattdesl/dictionary-of-colour-combinations, which builds on
a transcription by Dain M. Blodorn Kim (https://sanzo-wada.dmbk.io/). That data
