Corrections made against a printed copy of the book (e.g. Dull Violet Black's
CMYK recipe and several colour names) are part of haishoku.

The colours and combinations themselves are from Sanzo Wada's Haishoku Soukan
(1933-34), re-edited by Seigensha as A Dictionary of Color Combinations
(2010). Wada died in 1967 and the work is in the public domain in Japan. This
package is not affiliated with or endorsed by Seigensha.
